A||||1||RICK||Slow Power Windows
Z||000000||RICK||07-29-99||08:15 AM||||I have a 87SE v-6 with power windows and they are slow when they go up or down, are they just getting old and tired?  Any body know if there any fix-it solutions besides replacing the motors?
Z||000001||batboy||07-29-99||05:46 PM||||On the last two power windows that I worked on that ran up and down slow and sometimes needed a little help, one I had to replace the motor and on the other I just lubricated the gears, window regulator, and window tracks.
